        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/378c585e1a272cd9f800a9d758c1a531.webp?t=1767227138\" width=576 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/a82498af28b90c65ca77fa29d8ff3645.poster.avif?t=1767227138\" width=480 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/a82498af28b90c65ca77fa29d8ff3645.webm?t=1767227138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/a82498af28b90c65ca77fa29d8ff3645.mp4?t=1767227138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treasure 'n Trio </strong>is a single-player puzzle game based on the classic Sokoban.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player moves tile by tile, pushing objects and interacting with various puzzle mechanisms to progress through the stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/4b7bb991e0b3f85e0cfa0e56e51c4fa8.webp?t=1767227138\" width=576 height=41 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/955801e978dc703f7abca6264311542c.poster.avif?t=1767227138\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/955801e978dc703f7abca6264311542c.webm?t=1767227138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/955801e978dc703f7abca6264311542c.mp4?t=1767227138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can control three unique characters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A warrior who solves everything with brute force</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thief who ignores most dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cowardly wizard with teleportation magic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t solve the puzzles using just one character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use each one wisely to overcome the challenges ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/bbe1022c3146f827b1736f445cb33643.webp?t=1767227138\" width=576 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/4b22a50ee52a40dcb03de2ad8536a316.poster.avif?t=1767227138\" width=480 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/4b22a50ee52a40dcb03de2ad8536a316.webm?t=1767227138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/4b22a50ee52a40dcb03de2ad8536a316.mp4?t=1767227138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From peaceful forests to dangerous areas filled with bubbling lava,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each world offers a unique theme and a new kind of puzzle experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter distinctive monsters and puzzle elements that change with every world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/c794cb9067b3431b90ac427bcf1703ad.webp?t=1767227138\" width=576 height=41 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/84632988d4028a88e1fced787da6e80e.poster.avif?t=1767227138\" width=480 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/84632988d4028a88e1fced787da6e80e.webm?t=1767227138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/84632988d4028a88e1fced787da6e80e.mp4?t=1767227138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey deserves a reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a variety of unexpected treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you gather them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/03b9f250990b9233af1d8b19a1776056.webp?t=1767227138\" width=576 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/b2ed8d28a2ac9f27f41f6ef67d67a5b4.poster.avif?t=1767227138\" width=480 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/b2ed8d28a2ac9f27f41f6ef67d67a5b4.webm?t=1767227138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214530/extras/b2ed8d28a2ac9f27f41f6ef67d67a5b4.mp4?t=1767227138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those seeking an extra challenge, side quests are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These are high-difficulty modes where you must solve the same level under special conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give the side quests a try as well.</p>",
